  <h1>Chocolate Cake</h1>

  <p>This is a simple and delicious chocolate cake recipe that is easy to make at home.</p>

  <h2>Ingredients</h2>

  <ul>
    <li>Flour</li>
    <li>Sugar</li>
    <li>Eggs</li>
    <li>Cocoa powder</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Instructions</h2>

  <ol>
    <li>Mix the dry ingredients together.</li>
    <li>Add eggs and other wet ingredients.</li>
    <li>Bake the cake in the oven.</li>
    <li>Let it cool before serving.</li>
  </ol>

